  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(12, 4, 64)\n\n(8, 6, 14)\n\n**Logic:** Third number = [{(First no.)² - (Second no.)²} ÷ 2]\n\n**(12, 4, 64) →**\n\n⇒ [{(12)² - (4)²} ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ [(144 - 16) ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (128 ÷ 2) = 64\n\n**(8, 6, 14) →**\n\n⇒ [{(8)2 - (6)2} ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ [(64 - 36) ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (28 ÷ 2) = 14\n\nChecking all the given options:\n\n**1.** (7, 3, 28) →\n\n⇒ [{(7)2 - (3)2} ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ [(49 - 9) ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (40 ÷ 2) = 20\n\n**2.** (10, 6, 42) →\n\n⇒ [{(10)2 - (6)2} ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ [(100 - 36) ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (64 ÷ 2) = 32\n\n**3.** (11, 9, 15) →\n\n⇒ [{(11)2 - (9)2} ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ [(121 - 81) ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (40 ÷ 2) = 20\n\n**4. (9, 5, 28) →**\n\n⇒ [{(9)2 - (5)2} ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ [(81 - 25) ÷ 2]\n\n⇒ (56 ÷ 2) = **28**\n\nHere, (9, 5, 28) shows a similar relation to the given set of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (4)\".",
